  "prefLabel": "En 2102.12 Utility employee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 2102.12 “Utility employee” means an officer, director, employee, or agent of the utility who has specific knowledge of or who accesses customer information or distribution system information that could provide a competitive affiliate with an undue advantage.\n\nSource. #14519, eff 2-26-26, EXPIRES: 2-26-36",
